===Ask Hook what she wants from you{{subst:void|<!--201070500-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Boulder Town|update|Hook of the Moles wants to see you. As an honorary member of the Moles, it's your duty to answer her call.<br />Although Hook has the smugness of a child, you can't help but want to help her, perhaps out of pity.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Hook)
:'''Hook:''' Ah, honorary member of The Moles! Listen up!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What is it, Pitch-Dark Hook the Great?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What is it?
::'''Hook:''' How rude! You should have called me Pitch-Dark... Ugh, never mind...
:'''Hook:''' Thank you for helping Hook find the detector, but now Hook needs to ask you another favor...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Leave it to me.
::'''Hook:''' Haha, I haven't even mentioned what this is about! But that's the spirit. You truly are an honorary member of The Moles!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm all ears.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Allow me to refuse.
::'''Hook:''' Hmph, at least hear me out first before you refuse.
:'''Hook:''' Hook and daddy's birthday is approaching! Every year at this time, we exchange gifts and celebrate our birthday together.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You two share a birthday? What a coincidence!
:'''Hook:''' Yeah, what's the problem?
:'''Hook:''' Daddy's job has been more difficult since moving to Boulder Town. He gets home really late every day. I don't want to use his hard-earned money to buy a gift!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hook, you are so considerate.
::'''Hook:''' Hee-hee...
::'''Hook:''' Hey, are you patronizing me!?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why not ask Natasha for some money?
::'''Hook:''' ...Oh, I've broken a thing or two in the clinic, you see... I'm too embarrassed to ask for help from the old witch...
:'''Hook:''' Actually, I still have some valuable treasure of my own in Rivet Town. It's a shame I left it there. If I go bring it back and sell it for a decent price, I can buy a gift for daddy without begging anyone for money.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Rivet Town is in Fragmentum...
::'''Hook:''' I know that Rivet Town is super dangerous right now! That's why I'd like to enlist you as my bodyguard!
::'''Hook:''' That way, even if the old witch finds out later, I won't be the only one getting a scolding, hehe!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So you're begging me to help?
::'''Hook:''' Wh&mdash;What nonsense! This is an order from the boss of The Moles. An order!
::'''Hook:''' And I'm still a kid! You wouldn't let me go inside the Fragmentum by myself, would you?
:'''Hook:''' Then it's settled, let's meet in Rivet Town! I'll be waiting for you in a safe spot. You're not allowed to not come!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Meet Hook at Rivet Town{{subst:void|<!--201070503-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Rivet Town|update|Hook sets off alone, saying she will be waiting for you at a safe place in Rivet Town. But this town is corrupted by Fragmentum. Nowhere is safe.<br />It's the duty of an honorary member of the Moles to protect Hook, so you need to find her and bring her back as soon as possible.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Hook:''' (Trailblazer), what took you so long? Hook's been waiting here for ages!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sorry to have kept you waiting.
::'''Hook:''' ...Well, it wasn't actually that long. As long as you're here now, it's fine!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But I didn't take a single break on my way over.
::'''Hook:''' ...Okay, whatever you say. As long as you're here now, it's fine!
:'''Hook:''' I got some good news and some bad news. Which do you wanna hear first?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The bad news.
::'''Hook:''' I told the rest of The Moles about the plan, and Julian asked me to get some treasure for him. If we don't help him, he'll tell the old witch where we've gone!
::'''Hook:''' The good news is that he's willing to contribute to our adventure. Look, he gave me this gardening shovel!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The good news.
::'''Hook:''' Julian is willing to contribute to our adventure. Look, he gave me this gardening shovel!
::'''Hook:''' The bad news is that he asked us to help him get some treasure... Otherwise, he'll tell the old witch about our plan!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How dare he threaten the boss of The Moles!
::'''Hook:''' Well, Julian has been a huge help to me! Consider this returning the favor.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you really that scared of Natasha?
::'''Hook:''' Hehehehe her...? No, what? N&mdash;Nonsense, no! Nobody scares Pitch-Dark Hook the Great!
:'''Hook:''' Well, the treasure won't grow legs and find us, will it! Come on, let's go!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Find the treasure Julian needs{{subst:void|<!--201070510-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Rivet Town|update|Hook gives your plan away to Julian, and now you have to help Julian find his stuff so that he won't tell anybody else about it. Well, thanks Hook... <br />When the inhabitants of Rivet Town left, they left many things behind. You'll try your best to help them.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Hook:''' Julian's parents used to own a business in this area. When we were all forced to leave the town, there were lots of things they didn't have time to take with them.
:'''Hook:''' ...It shouldn't be too hard to locate his treasure! Let's start by looking over there!
----
:'''Hook:''' Ah, we found Julian's treasure! No, not the key &mdash; these glass marbles. Look at all the different colors! I bet it wasn't easy collecting all these.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are these marbles used for?
::'''Hook:''' What? Hee-hee, you don't know? Have you never played marbles before!?
::'''Hook:''' By the way, what does this key open? Maybe Julian knows...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I thought the key was the treasure...
::'''Hook:''' No, these marbles are what he's after.
::'''Hook:''' But I'm also curious... What does this key open? Let's ask Julian when we get back.
:'''Hook:''' What's that look on your face? Oh, I get it. You don't think this jar of glass marbles is worth anything, right?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It doesn't look like anything special.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's not what I was thinking...
::'''Hook:''' Hmph, don't even try to pretend otherwise! The look on your face sold you out!
:'''Hook:''' Let me tell you something, this jar of marbles means a lot to The Moles.
:'''Hook:''' Julian used it to help The Moles overcome a super-huge crisis, for which he was promoted to second-in-command!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He defeated Fragmentum monsters with marbles?
::'''Hook:''' Of course it wasn't that. But his accomplishments are nothing to be scoffed at!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The crisis you're referring to...
::'''Hook:''' It was a super-huge crisis that jeopardized The Moles' honor!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sounds like kids playing make-believe!
::'''Hook:''' You're being a rude adult again... Believe me, I'm not exaggerating when I say that crisis was super huge!
:'''Hook:''' In the past, the kids in town were archrivals to us at the orphanage! Those kids used to bully us, relying on the pocket money that their parents gave 'em.
:'''Hook:''' One time, they sent us a formal declaration of war &mdash; challenging The Moles to a marbles competition!
:'''Hook:''' We were all well aware that we didn't stand a chance! We at the orphanage only had some old glass marbles we scavenged from the side of the road, which were no match for those rich kids' marbles!
:'''Hook:''' Nonetheless, Julian bravely accepted the challenge... and triumphantly returned with a pile of colorful glass marbles he won! It was incredible!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wow, what a little hero.
::'''Hook:''' Yep. So now you know why he wanted us to find this treasure.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's no wonder he values these marbles so much.
::'''Hook:''' Yep. So now you know why he wanted us to find this treasure.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's it?
::'''Hook:''' After that epic story, that's all you have to say? Ugh... I would've been better off telling a stone-grilled olm instead.
:'''Hook:''' Alright, enough chit-chat! Next we need to find my treasure.
----
;(Obtain {{Предмет|Rusted Key|20|x=1}})
{{Dialogue End}}

