:'''Hook:''' N&mdash;Natasha! Junjun's in bad shape. Can you help me fix him...?
:'''Natasha:''' I remember giving you Junjun. I haven't seen this fella in years. Where did you find him?
:'''Hook:''' The... the wind brought him back to me...
:'''Natasha:''' Be honest with me, Hook.
:'''Hook:''' ...(Trailblazer) helped me find him in the Rivet Town orphanage.
:'''Natasha:''' You had (Trailblazer) take you to the Fragmentum just for this teddy bear? Hook, how many times have I told you...?
:'''Hook:''' Natasha, please! Please help me fix Junjun. I'll clean the clinic for you for a whole month!
:'''Natasha:''' *sigh* You say that every time, and then...
:'''Hook:''' G&mdash;Great, seeya soon! (Trailblazer), I'll leave Junjun with you!
----
:'''Natasha:''' ...What am I going to do with that girl.
:'''Natasha:''' You shouldn't indulge her, outsider. Uh-uh, I know it's difficult to tell Hook "no," but sometimes it just has to be done.
:'''Natasha:''' Junjun... so she gave her bear a name, huh?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hook seems really fond of this bear.
::'''Natasha:''' I've lost count of all the dolls I've made. To be honest, I wasn't expecting her to like this one so much.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It seems like a regular teddy bear to me.
::'''Natasha:''' Yeah, I've lost count of all the dolls I've made. Still, Hook clearly likes this one a lot.
:'''Natasha:''' It was an award I used to give the kids in Rivet Town for "good behavior." Can you imagine what an orphanage is like with so many difficult children? I had to come up with a solution to get them to behave.
:'''Natasha:''' Hook pretended to be well-behaved for a month in order to get Junjun. She ate on time, slept on time &mdash; even stopped fighting with the other kids...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That must have been some difficult pretending...
::'''Natasha:''' Of course, as soon as she got her award, she went straight back to her old self.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Maybe she's actually a well-behaved kid pretending to be naughty...
::'''Natasha:''' I'm afraid you have no idea how much she suffered that month.
:'''Natasha:''' Hook has an uncanny ability to rally people to her cause &mdash; both adults and children. It's a skill alright, and forcing her to be well-behaved puts a lid on it.
:'''Natasha:''' ...Well, this teddy bear has sure been through the wars. Don't worry, I'll help Hook repair Junjun, but I'll need to find some stuffing...
:'''Natasha:''' W&mdash;Wait, look at the eyes...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Pretty, they look like gemstones.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Round and black.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are they moving?
::'''Natasha:''' Ugh, please don't say that...
:'''Natasha:''' They must be... erebus? Strange, I didn't notice when I sewed them on...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are they worth a lot?
::'''Natasha:''' I'm no appraiser, but these two gems look to be high quality.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What a surprise...
::'''Natasha:''' There's no shortage of surprises in life.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Were you distracted or something?
::'''Natasha:''' I think I must have been &mdash; it's not every day you sew precious gems into a teddy bear. Honestly...
:'''Natasha:''' Well, our war torn bear here just became a priceless doll. Not bad, Junjun.

;(Talk to Natasha)
:'''Natasha:''' Let's talk later. Go and find Hook, she can't have gone too far...
:'''Natasha:''' *sigh* That girl... I'd barely gotten two sentences out.
:'''Natasha:''' Hook? What are you...
